    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset includes the model of the production 1 unit of office chair including the end of life of its materials.&#13;
The following life cycle phases are included :&#13;
Manufacturing chair components&#13;
Manufacturing chair packaging&#13;
Manufacturing -chair&#13;
Distribution&#13;
Use &amp; maintenance&#13;
End of life</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
    </technology>
